  "sources": [
    "Microsoft Learn: 'Manage connections from Windows operating system components to Microsoft services', section 18.16 Feedback & diagnostics: AllowTelemetry = 0 under HKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\DataCollection. The 'Security' level only exists in Enterprise and Education; Home and Pro treat 0 like 1 ('Required').",
    "The policy is described in the Policy CSP for Pro, Enterprise and Education; Windows Home reads the same registry value, but Microsoft makes no promise for Home."
